> necessitate the 'export' command, in order to reset the exported value.  For
> example,
>
> sh-3.2$ export foo=bar
> sh-3.2$ env | grep foo
> foo=bar
> sh-3.2$ foo=bar2
> sh-3.2$ env | grep foo
> foo=bar2
