> option in justRMA that can do this (or any other function that can do
> this?) I searched the options on justRMA, does not seem to have this
> option.

You can output probe-set level data, then use the function
collapseRows in the WGCNA package (CRAN) to summarize probesets for
each gene to a single value.

Best,

Peter


