Hi,

Perhaps using absolute path for the `filename` argument (eg.
`/Users/YOU/Desktop/single_Venn.tiff`) instead of relying on a
`setwd()` call ("maybe the tilde-expansion thing isn't working in your
script?).

Anyway, using an absolute path for the file will avoid you having to
guess where to look -- it'll either be where you (unambiguously) told
it to be, or it won't.

-steve

